    "text": "When <math><msub><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>92</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>235</mn></mrow></msup></math> is bombarded with one neutron, fission occurs and the products are three neutrons, <math><msub><mrow><mi>&nbsp;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>36</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>94</mn></mrow></msup></math> , and"
